{"seq":1,"slug":"controller-runtime","title":"Controller-Runtime 架构与内部机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/development/controller-runtime","wordCount":1332,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"controller-runtime-架构与内部机制\">Controller-Runtime 架构与内部机制</h1><p>controller-runtime 是 Kubernetes SIG（Special Interest Group）维护的 Go 语言库，为所有基于 Go 的 Operator 提供核心运行时基础设施。Kubebuilder 和 Operator SDK 都构建在它之上。理解 controller-runtime 的分层架构——Manager、Controller、Cache、Client、Source/Handler/Predicate——是编写正确且高效的 Operator 的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Manager</strong>：顶层编排器，管理 Controller、Cache、Webhook 的生命周期，提供 Leader Election 和健康检查</li>\n<li><strong>Cache</strong>：基于 Informer 的本地内存对象缓存，提供最终一致的低延迟读取（毫秒级延迟）</li>\n<li><strong>Client 读写分离</strong>：读请求走 Cache（本地），写请求直连 API Server，兼顾性能与正确性</li>\n<li><strong>Source/EventHandler/Predicate 管道</strong>：事件从 Informer 到 Work Queue 的三级过滤与映射</li>\n<li><strong>MaxConcurrentReconciles</strong>：并发调谐数控制，不同资源可并行，同一资源保证串行</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"架构分层\">架构分层</h2><p>controller-runtime 的核心组件形成清晰的层次结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Manager&#10;        direction TB&#10;        LE[Leader Election] --- HC[Health Check]&#10;        HC --- WH[Webhook Server]&#10;    end&#10;    Manager --&gt; Cache&#10;    Manager --&gt; Client&#10;    Manager --&gt; CTRL[Controller]&#10;&#10;    subgraph Cache&#10;        INF[Informers] --- IDX[Indexers]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph CTRL[Controller]&#10;        SRC[Source] --&gt; HND[EventHandler]&#10;        HND --&gt; PRD[Predicates]&#10;        PRD --&gt; WQ[Work Queue]&#10;        WQ --&gt; REC[Reconciler]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    Cache --&gt; |读取| REC&#10;    Client --&gt; |写入| REC\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Manager\n        direction TB\n        LE[Leader Election] --- HC[Health Check]\n        HC --- WH[Webhook Server]\n    end\n    Manager --&gt; Cache\n    Manager --&gt; Client\n    Manager --&gt; CTRL[Controller]\n\n    subgraph Cache\n        INF[Informers] --- IDX[Indexers]\n    end\n\n    subgraph CTRL[Controller]\n        SRC[Source] --&gt; HND[EventHandler]\n        HND --&gt; PRD[Predicates]\n        PRD --&gt; WQ[Work Queue]\n        WQ --&gt; REC[Reconciler]\n    end\n\n    Cache --&gt; |读取| REC\n    Client --&gt; |写入| REC</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>关键配置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Manager</td>\n<td>生命周期编排：启动/停止所有组件、Leader Election、健康检查</td>\n<td><code>LeaderElection</code>, <code>HealthProbeBindAddress</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache</td>\n<td>维护 API 对象的本地内存副本，基于 Informer</td>\n<td><code>SyncPeriod</code>, <code>ByObject</code> scope</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Client</td>\n<td>API Server 读写客户端（读走缓存，写走直连）</td>\n<td><code>CacheReader</code>, <code>DirectClient</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Controller</td>\n<td>事件分发与调谐调度</td>\n<td><code>MaxConcurrentReconciles</code>, <code>RateLimiter</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Source</td>\n<td>事件来源（Watch 某个 GVK）</td>\n<td><code>Kind</code>, <code>Channel</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EventHandler</td>\n<td>将事件映射为调谐请求（决定&quot;谁被重新调谐&quot;）</td>\n<td><code>EnqueueRequestForObject</code>, <code>EnqueueRequestForOwner</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Predicate</td>\n<td>事件过滤（减少不必要的调谐）</td>\n<td><code>GenerationChangedPredicate</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"manager-运行时容器\">Manager：运行时容器</h2><p>Manager 是 controller-runtime 的顶层编排器。一个 Operator 进程通常只有一个 Manager 实例，它负责：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>组件注册</strong>：Controller、Webhook、Runnable（自定义后台任务）都注册到 Manager</li>\n<li><strong>统一启动</strong>：<code>mgr.Start(ctx)</code> 按依赖顺序启动 Cache → Controller → Webhook</li>\n<li><strong>Leader Election</strong>：确保同一 Operator 的多副本中只有一个活跃调谐</li>\n<li><strong>健康检查</strong>：暴露 <code>/healthz</code>（存活）和 <code>/readyz</code>（就绪）端点</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"mgr, err := ctrl.NewManager(ctrl.GetConfigOrDie(), ctrl.Options{&#10;    Scheme:                  scheme,&#10;    Metrics:                 metricsserver.Options{BindAddress: &quot;:8080&quot;},&#10;    HealthProbeBindAddress:  &quot;:8081&quot;,&#10;    LeaderElection:          true,&#10;    LeaderElectionID:        &quot;database-operator.example.com&quot;,&#10;    // Cache 作用域限制：只缓存特定 namespace&#10;    Cache: cache.Options{&#10;        DefaultNamespaces: map[string]cache.Config{&#10;            &quot;production&quot;: {},&#10;            &quot;staging&quot;:    {},&#10;        },&#10;    },&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mgr, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctrl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctrl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetConfigOrDie</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Scheme:                  scheme,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Metrics:                 </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">metricsserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{BindAddress: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\":8080\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    HealthProbeBindAddress:  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\":8081\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    LeaderElection:          </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    LeaderElectionID:        </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"database-operator.example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Cache 作用域限制：只缓存特定 namespace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Cache: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        DefaultNamespaces: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"staging\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:    {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Leader Election 机制</strong>：controller-runtime 使用 Kubernetes Lease 资源实现 Leader Election。持有 Lease 的 Pod 是 Leader——只有 Leader 的 Controller 会执行调谐。当 Leader 不可用时（心跳超时，默认 15 秒），其他副本竞争 Lease 完成切换。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LeaseDuration</td>\n<td>15s</td>\n<td>Lease 持有时间，超时后其他副本可竞争</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RenewDeadline</td>\n<td>10s</td>\n<td>Leader 必须在此时间内续约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RetryPeriod</td>\n<td>2s</td>\n<td>非 Leader 竞争 Lease 的重试间隔</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cache-informer-的高级封装\">Cache：Informer 的高级封装</h2><p>Cache 是对 client-go Informer 机制的封装，为 Controller 提供低延迟的本地读取。其核心行为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>启动时对每个注册的 GVK 执行 <strong>List</strong>（全量拉取）</li>\n<li>建立 <strong>Watch</strong> 长连接接收增量更新</li>\n<li>将所有对象保存在内存 Store 中，Controller 读取不走 API Server</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Cache 的一致性模型</strong>：Cache 提供的是<strong>最终一致</strong>的视图——从 API Server 的变更事件到本地 Cache 更新之间有延迟（通常毫秒级，但在集群压力大时可达秒级）。Reconciler 读到的状态可能是&quot;几秒前的快照&quot;。这意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>刚创建的子资源可能在下一次 Get 中尚不可见</li>\n<li>刚删除的资源可能仍然出现在 List 结果中</li>\n<li>调谐逻辑必须容忍读到过时数据</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Cache Scope 优化</strong>：默认情况下 Cache 会缓存整个集群中某个 GVK 的所有对象。对于管理特定 namespace 的 Operator，可以通过 <code>DefaultNamespaces</code> 限制缓存范围，显著降低内存占用和 API Server 负载。</p>\n<p><strong>自定义索引</strong>：Cache 支持自定义索引字段，用于快速查找满足特定条件的对象：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 为 Pod 建立按 nodeName 的索引&#10;mgr.GetFieldIndexer().IndexField(ctx, &amp;corev1.Pod{}, &quot;spec.nodeName&quot;,&#10;    func(obj client.Object) []string {&#10;        pod := obj.(*corev1.Pod)&#10;        return []string{pod.Spec.NodeName}&#10;    },&#10;)&#10;&#10;// 查询时使用索引&#10;var podsOnNode corev1.PodList&#10;r.List(ctx, &amp;podsOnNode, client.MatchingFields{&#10;    &quot;spec.nodeName&quot;: &quot;worker-01&quot;,&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 为 Pod 建立按 nodeName 的索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mgr.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetFieldIndexer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IndexField</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">corev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"spec.nodeName\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">obj</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        pod </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj.(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">corev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{pod.Spec.NodeName}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 查询时使用索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> podsOnNode </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">corev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PodList</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">List</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">podsOnNode, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MatchingFields</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"spec.nodeName\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"worker-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"client-读写分离模型\">Client：读写分离模型</h2><p>controller-runtime 的 Client 实现了读写分离：<strong>读请求默认走 Cache</strong>（本地内存），<strong>写请求直连 API Server</strong>。这个设计在大多数场景下兼顾了性能与正确性，但开发者需要理解其边界：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 读取：走 Cache（最终一致）&#10;var db databasev1.Database&#10;err := r.Get(ctx, req.NamespacedName, &amp;db)&#10;&#10;// 写入：直连 API Server&#10;err := r.Update(ctx, &amp;db)&#10;&#10;// 需要强一致读时：绕过 Cache 直连 API Server&#10;err := r.Get(ctx, req.NamespacedName, &amp;db,&#10;    &amp;client.GetOptions{Raw: &amp;metav1.GetOptions{&#10;        ResourceVersion: &quot;0&quot;,  // 不使用缓存&#10;    }},&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 读取：走 Cache（最终一致）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">databasev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, req.NamespacedName, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 写入：直连 API Server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 需要强一致读时：绕过 Cache 直连 API Server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, req.NamespacedName, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Raw: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">metav1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ResourceVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不使用缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"source-eventhandler-与-predicate\">Source、EventHandler 与 Predicate</h2><p>这三个组件构成了事件从 Informer 到 Work Queue 的管道：</p>\n<p><strong>Source</strong>：声明 Controller 监听哪些资源的变更。<code>source.Kind</code> 监听特定 GVK，<code>source.Channel</code> 接收外部事件（如定时器、消息队列）。</p>\n<p><strong>EventHandler</strong>：决定事件触发谁的调谐。最常用的三种：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 1. 资源本身变更 → 调谐该资源&#10;For(&amp;databasev1.Database{})&#10;&#10;// 2. 子资源变更 → 调谐其 Owner（通过 OwnerReference 回溯）&#10;Owns(&amp;appsv1.StatefulSet{})&#10;&#10;// 3. 不相关资源变更 → 自定义映射到需要调谐的资源&#10;Watches(&amp;corev1.Secret{}, handler.EnqueueRequestsFromMapFunc(&#10;    func(ctx context.Context, obj client.Object) []reconcile.Request {&#10;        // 找到引用了该 Secret 的所有 Database CR&#10;        return findDatabasesReferencingSecret(obj)&#10;    },&#10;))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 资源本身变更 → 调谐该资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">For</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">databasev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 子资源变更 → 调谐其 Owner（通过 OwnerReference 回溯）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Owns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appsv1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StatefulSet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 不相关资源变更 → 自定义映射到需要调谐的资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Watches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">corev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Secret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, handler.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">EnqueueRequestsFromMapFunc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">obj</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reconcile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 找到引用了该 Secret 的所有 Database CR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findDatabasesReferencingSecret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obj)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Predicate</strong>：过滤事件，减少不必要的调谐。最常用的是 <code>GenerationChangedPredicate</code>——它只在 spec 变更时（generation 递增）触发调谐，忽略纯 status 更新和 annotation 修改：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"ctrl.NewControllerManagedBy(mgr).&#10;    For(&amp;databasev1.Database{}, builder.WithPredicates(&#10;        predicate.GenerationChangedPredicate{},&#10;    )).&#10;    Owns(&amp;appsv1.StatefulSet{}).&#10;    Complete(r)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctrl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewControllerManagedBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mgr).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    For</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">databasev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, builder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithPredicates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        predicate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GenerationChangedPredicate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    Owns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appsv1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StatefulSet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    Complete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"maxconcurrentreconciles-与性能调优\">MaxConcurrentReconciles 与性能调优</h2><p><code>MaxConcurrentReconciles</code> 控制单个 Controller 的并发调谐数。默认值为 1（串行），但对于管理大量 CR 的 Operator，增大并发可以显著缩短调谐延迟：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n<th>考量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>管理 &lt;100 个 CR</td>\n<td>1（默认）</td>\n<td>串行足够，避免并发复杂性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管理 100-1000 个 CR</td>\n<td>5-10</td>\n<td>减少队列积压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管理 1000+ 个 CR</td>\n<td>10-50</td>\n<td>需确保 API Server 可承受写入速率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调谐涉及长耗时外部调用</td>\n<td>20+</td>\n<td>避免一个慢调用阻塞其他资源的调谐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意：<code>MaxConcurrentReconciles</code> 不会对同一资源产生并发——Work Queue 保证同一 key 同一时刻只有一个 Reconciler 在处理。并发是指不同资源的调谐可以并行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>controller-runtime 的分层架构为 Operator 开发提供了生产级的基础设施：Manager 统一编排生命周期，Cache 提供低延迟的最终一致读取，Client 实现读写分离，Source/EventHandler/Predicate 管道精确控制调谐触发。理解这些组件的行为边界——特别是 Cache 的最终一致性语义和 Leader Election 的切换延迟——是写出正确 Operator 的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"kubebuilder-operator-sdk\">Kubebuilder 与 Operator SDK 工程实践</a>——在 controller-runtime 之上的框架与脚手架</li>\n<li><a href=\"webhooks-validation\">Webhook 准入控制开发</a>——Manager 中的 Webhook Server 组件详解</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Controller-Runtime 架构与内部机制","id":"controller-runtime-架构与内部机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"架构分层","id":"架构分层"},{"level":2,"text":"Manager：运行时容器","id":"manager-运行时容器"},{"level":2,"text":"Cache：Informer 的高级封装","id":"cache-informer-的高级封装"},{"level":2,"text":"Client：读写分离模型","id":"client-读写分离模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Source、EventHandler 与 Predicate","id":"source-eventhandler-与-predicate"},{"level":2,"text":"MaxConcurrentReconciles 与性能调优","id":"maxconcurrentreconciles-与性能调优"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"调谐循环深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/foundations/reconciliation-loop"},"next":{"title":"Kubebuilder 与 Operator SDK 工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/development/kubebuilder-operator-sdk"}}